    {
      "block_id": "1212.0957_p11_b53",
      "text": "The Hankel transform of a sequence \u03b1n is the sequence of Hankel deter-\nminants det (\u03b1i+j)0\u2264i,j\u2264n. A number of methods for computing the Hankel\ndeterminants have been widely investigated [4, 5, 6, 9]. It is well known that\nthe Hankel transform of sequences \u03b1n and \u03b2n are equal under the binomial\ntransform [7]\n",
